0
//----------------------------------------------------------
// Timing
// How long before the event opens, when it is announced, how long it lasts and when it closes.
//   Warning: Minutes before the start in which players can already go in. The server announces it every minute.
//   Waiting Time: Minutes players wait inside after the entrance closes, before the event begins.
//   Event: Minutes the event lasts once it begins.
//   Closing: Minutes after the event ends before the place is cleaned and everyone is sent out.
//----------------------------------------------------------
//  WarningTime    NotifyTime    EventTime    CloseTime
//----------------------------------------------------------
    5              1             15           1
end

1
//----------------------------------------------------------
// Level Groups
// The range that can enter each one: one for Dark Wizard, Dark Knight, Elf and Summoner and another for Magic Gladiator, Dark Lord and Rage Fighter. The value compared is the level, the resets or the master resets, as the DevilSquareStyle setting of the Event settings says.
//   Level: 0 to 5 are Devil Square 1 to 6. 6 is Devil Square 7, the Master Level one: it is switched on with a lowest value of 0.
//   Normal min: The lowest value that enters this one, for Dark Wizard, Dark Knight, Elf and Summoner. It is compared with the character's level, resets or master resets, as the DevilSquareStyle setting of the Event settings says (0 level, 1 resets, 2 master resets).
//   Normal max: The highest value that enters this one, for Dark Wizard, Dark Knight, Elf and Summoner.
//   Special min: The lowest value that enters this one, for Magic Gladiator, Dark Lord and Rage Fighter.
//   Special max: The highest value that enters this one, for Magic Gladiator, Dark Lord and Rage Fighter.
//----------------------------------------------------------
//  [0~6]    [0~1000]    [0~1000]    [0~1000]     [0~1000]
//  Level    MinLevel    MaxLevel    MinLevel2    MaxLevel2
//----------------------------------------------------------
    0        0           4           0            4
    1        5           19          5            19
    2        20          39          20           39
    3        40          59          40           59
    4        60          79          60           79
    5        80          1000        80           1000
    6        0           0           0            0
end

2
//---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Schedules
// When the Devil Square starts.
//   Year: The year it starts. A wildcard means every year.
//   Month: The month it starts, 1 to 12. A wildcard means every month.
//   Day: The day of the month it starts, 1 to 31. A wildcard means every day.
//   Day of the week: -1 Every day | 1 Sunday | 2 Monday | 3 Tuesday | 4 Wednesday | 5 Thursday | 6 Friday | 7 Saturday
//   Hour: The hour it starts, 0 to 23. A wildcard means every hour.
//   Minute: The minute it starts, 0 to 59. A wildcard means every minute.
//   Second: The second it starts, 0 to 59.
//   Min. Account Level: -1 Every account level | 0 Free | 1 VIP 1 | 2 VIP 2 | 3 VIP 3
//---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
//  [Number]    [*/0~12]    [*/0~31]    [*/1~7]      [*/0~23]    [*/0~59]    [*/0~59]    [Number]
//  Year        Month       Day         DayOfWeek    Hour        Minute      Second      AccountLevel
