//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Experience
// Kill-count ranking, ranks 1 to 10.
//   Level: The square: 0 to 5 are Devil Square 1 to 6; 6 is the Master Level one (Devil Square 7).
//   Rank 1: Experience for the player who finishes in position 1 of the kill ranking.
//   Rank 2: Experience for the player who finishes in position 2 of the kill ranking.
//   Rank 3: Experience for the player who finishes in position 3 of the kill ranking.
//   Rank 4: Experience for the player who finishes in position 4 of the kill ranking.
//   Rank 5: Experience for the player who finishes in position 5 of the kill ranking.
//   Rank 6: Experience for the player who finishes in position 6 of the kill ranking.
//   Rank 7: Experience for the player who finishes in position 7 of the kill ranking.
